.TH SDL_GetAndroidExternalStorageState 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetAndroidExternalStorageState \- Get the current state of external storage for this Android application.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "Uint32 SDL_GetAndroidExternalStorageState(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The current state of external storage, a bitmask of these values:
.BR SDL_ANDROID_EXTERNAL_STORAGE_READ ,
.BR SDL_ANDROID_EXTERNAL_STORAGE_WRITE \[char46]
.PP
If external storage is currently unavailable, this will return 0\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the current state of external storage, or 0 if external storage is currently unavailable\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

